  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_4966.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda ha vivido este martes un d&iacute;a eminentemente taurino en sus fiestas. Aunque no estaba anunciada, por la noche ha habido embolada de un novillo de la ganader&iacute;a El Mijares en la calle Padre Ten, frente a la Tasca El Tronc, con un banco de Cerrajer&iacute;a Ferroal.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4939.jpg\" alt=\"img_4939\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4940.jpg\" alt=\"img_4940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4941.jpg\" alt=\"img_4941\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4942.jpg\" alt=\"img_4942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4943.jpg\" alt=\"img_4943\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4944.jpg\" alt=\"img_4944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4945.jpg\" alt=\"img_4945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoaquim13/img_4946.jpg\" alt=\"img_4946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbouetembolatsantjoa